 *
 * ```
 * │ Finance ▸ Reports                      [Simple ◉ | Detailed ○] │
 * │                                        [🔍 find a report]      │
 * │ SIMPLE (default)                                               │
 * │ ┌────────┐┌────────┐┌────────┐┌────────┐  the locked Pulse row │
