            </p>
          </div>

          <Unavailable
            reason="A quote sandbox books nothing. Carrying these figures into a booking needs the draft hand-off New Rental owns; nothing on this page may write one."
            style={{ marginTop: 'var(--sp-md)', width: '100%' }}
          >
