                    {/* §12 */}Models only, never serials. A unit is assigned at packing from whatever is free. </p>
                  <ul style={{ margin: 0, paddingLeft: 'var(--sp-lg)', display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column', gap: 3 }}>
                    {lines.map((l) => {
